  "totalBlocks": 97,
  "translatedBlocks": 97,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abf57c3556caff24",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 研究员 Stas Bekman 的客座博文",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfb38a025332162a",
      "translationZh": "近来机器学习模型规模的膨胀速度远超新发布显卡所增加的显存容量，许多用户因此无法在自己的硬件上训练、甚至无法仅仅加载这些巨型模型。虽然把其中一些超大模型蒸馏到更易管理规模的工作一直在进行，但这一努力的产出既不够小、也来得不够快。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e8ff8943a05a43d",
      "translationZh": "2019 年秋，Samyam Rajbhandari、Jeff Rasley、Olatunji Ruwase 和 Yuxiong He 发表了论文《ZeRO: Memory Optimizations Toward Training Trillion Parameter Models》，其中包含大量巧妙的新思路，能让硬件做到远超人们此前想象的事情。不久之后 DeepSpeed 发布，把论文中的大多数思路以开源形式带给了世界（少数思路仍在开发中）；几乎同时，Facebook 的一个团队发布了 FairScale，同样实现了 ZeRO 论文中的部分核心思想。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "454223a9cb5d0def",
      "translationZh": "如果你使用 Hugging Face Trainer，从 transformers v4.2.0 起已提供对 DeepSpeed 和 FairScale 的 ZeRO 特性的实验性支持。新的 --sharded_ddp 和 --deepspeed 命令行 Trainer 参数分别提供 FairScale 和 DeepSpeed 集成。完整文档在此。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac647441d74fa1f0",
      "translationZh": "这篇博文将介绍，无论你只有一块 GPU 还是一整叠 GPU，都能如何从 ZeRO 中获益。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "043810066f2a4f19",
      "translationZh": "多 GPU 配置带来的巨大加速",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbec58d96b32269c",
      "translationZh": "我们用一个 t5-large 模型做一次小型翻译任务微调实验，使用 transformers GitHub 仓库 examples/seq2seq 下的 finetune_trainer.py 脚本。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e386e3b21e27b23a",
      "translationZh": "我们有两块 24GB（Titan RTX）GPU 用于测试。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23319ffea540d3b3",
      "translationZh": "这只是概念验证性质的基准测试，显然仍有进一步优化的空间，因此我们用 2000 条训练样本和 500 条评估样本的小数据集来进行对比。评估默认执行大小为 4 的束搜索（beam search），所以相同样本数下评估比训练慢，这也是这些测试中评估样本少四倍的原因。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8f627d979c5d68e",
      "translationZh": "以下是我们基线配置的关键命令行参数：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0379cd019916668b",
      "translationZh": "基线只使用了 DistributedDataParallel（DDP），没有叠加任何其他加速手段。在碰到显存不足（OOM）错误之前，我能塞进 16 的批大小（BS）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb98a207745d4867",
      "translationZh": "注意，为简洁和便于理解，这里只展示了与本次演示相关的命令行参数，完整命令行见这篇文章。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88bfaf53109563d4",
      "translationZh": "接下来，我们在每次重跑基准时加入以下其中一项：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c32a1ec1e7744433",
      "translationZh": "--fp16",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c474779f916dcb3c",
      "translationZh": "--sharded_ddp (fairscale)",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e29ba9707fd15574",
      "translationZh": "--sharded_ddp --fp16 (fairscale)",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "96e18f203984e835",
      "translationZh": "--deepspeed（不启用 CPU 卸载）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5d3525061f18038",
      "translationZh": "--deepspeed（启用 CPU 卸载）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0797fcef4b314fe4",
      "translationZh": "由于这里的关键优化是各项技术以更高效率利用显存，我们将持续增大批大小，并预期训练和评估完成得更快（同时保持指标稳定甚至有所改善，不过这里不关注指标）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48c73c10483a377b",
      "translationZh": "要记住训练和评估两个阶段差异很大：训练时会修改模型权重、计算梯度并存储优化器状态；评估时这些都不发生，但在翻译这个特定任务里，模型要搜索最佳假设，实际上得多次运行才肯罢休。这就是它不快的原因，模型越大越是如此。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d525a8ad9507d47f",
      "translationZh": "来看看这六组测试的结果：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52a0f9b65b278850",
      "translationZh": "方法",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13a5a7c6c73d4c53",
      "translationZh": "最大 BS",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de3ed60717f39a60",
      "translationZh": "训练耗时",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55cdecb5c81dc502",
      "translationZh": "评估耗时",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ba8496a2525ae17",
      "translationZh": "基线",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6a4b2a5a63967d5",
      "translationZh": "fp16",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fc186350782a310",
      "translationZh": "sharded_ddp",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc85c5583eecaafe",
      "translationZh": "sharded_ddp+fp16",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ce2d4be98201229",
      "translationZh": "deepspeed（无 CPU 卸载）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e6fa15cefdcdc86",
      "translationZh": "deepspeed（有 CPU 卸载）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "869a6b9c9772e3cd",
      "translationZh": "很容易看出，FairScale 和 DeepSpeed 相比基线都有巨大提升，总训练与评估时间和批大小皆然。截至撰写本文，DeepSpeed 实现了更多魔法，短期来看是赢家，但 FairScale 部署更简单：DeepSpeed 需要写一个简单的配置文件并更换命令行启动器，FairScale 只需加上 --sharded_ddp 命令行参数，所以不妨先试它——这是最容易摘到的果子。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07910d68569f289d",
      "translationZh": "按照 80:20 法则，这些基准测试我只花了几个小时，没有刻意通过细化命令行参数和配置去榨干每一 MB 显存和每一秒时间——从这张简单的表格就能清楚看出下一步该试什么。等你面对的是要跑上几个小时甚至几天的真实项目时，一定要花更多时间确保用到最优超参数，让任务完成得更快、成本最低。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "054eff6b19b7c7f6",
      "translationZh": "如果你想自己动手实验这个基准，或想了解所用软硬件的更多细节，请参阅这篇文章。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c55de6ef9665641d",
      "translationZh": "把巨型模型塞进单张 GPU",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1d36892699f68ac",
      "translationZh": "FairScale 只有多 GPU 时才能带来提升，而 DeepSpeed 即便对我们这些只有单卡的人也有礼物。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a674ddd1bcfed8d0",
      "translationZh": "来试试不可能的事：在 24GB 的 RTX-3090 卡上训练 t5-3b。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31f9bbec9eb5392e",
      "translationZh": "先用普通的单 GPU 设置尝试微调巨型 t5-3b：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0cdeb814b88fd49c",
      "translationZh": "没戏，即使 BS=1 也得到：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef2c4e07ea71a00e",
      "translationZh": "注意，和前面一样，我只展示关键部分，完整命令行参数见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e29647cd92fa7c5",
      "translationZh": "现在把 transformers 升级到 v4.2.0 或更高，然后安装 DeepSpeed：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "859c2ad0d5989a3c",
      "translationZh": "再试一次，这次在命令行加上 DeepSpeed：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2eaccc72cbbce3ca",
      "translationZh": "瞧！批大小 20 顺利训练完成，应该还能再往上推。BS=30 时程序因 OOM 失败。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a0a92c1d7a58f77",
      "translationZh": "相关结果如下：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bd42b4ea3463fb3",
      "translationZh": "这些结果无法与基线比较，因为基线根本跑不起来，立刻就因 OOM 失败了。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6be8e90780289913",
      "translationZh": "太惊人了！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "275d400ddb46ee89",
      "translationZh": "我只用了很小的样本，因为我主要关心的是能否用这个通常塞不进 24GB GPU 的巨型模型进行训练和评估。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "054eff6b19b7c7f6",
      "translationZh": "如果你想自己动手实验这个基准，或想了解所用软硬件的更多细节，请参阅这篇文章。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c08c8d58d4bcbb63",
      "translationZh": "ZeRO 背后的魔法",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95d539260c6930de",
      "translationZh": "由于 transformers 只是集成了这些出色的方案，并非其发明者，我会分享一些资源供你自己发掘全部细节。不过先给出几条简明洞见，帮助理解 ZeRO 如何成就这些惊人的壮举。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea69bab39146dbd1",
      "translationZh": "ZeRO 的关键特性，是在大家相当熟悉的数据并行训练概念之上加入分布式数据存储。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b8e30ccfde71518",
      "translationZh": "每块 GPU 上的计算与数据并行训练完全相同，但参数、梯度和优化器状态以分布式/分区方式存储在所有 GPU 上，只在需要时才取用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cd8d07fa28cb693",
      "translationZh": "下面这张来自这篇博文的图示说明了它的工作原理：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b476143f36e15dbc",
      "translationZh": "ZeRO 的巧妙之处在于把参数、梯度和优化器状态均分到所有 GPU 上，每块 GPU 只持有一个分区（也称分片，shard），从而使 GPU 之间的数据存储零重叠。运行时，每块 GPU 通过向其他参与的 GPU 请求所缺信息，即时构建每层所需的数据。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c83cc4bd8cca578f",
      "translationZh": "这个思路可能不太好懂，这里是我的一次解释尝试。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de4fd6d71113b354",
      "translationZh": "截至撰写本文，FairScale 和 DeepSpeed 只对优化器状态和梯度做分区（分片）。模型参数分片据称将很快在 DeepSpeed 和 FairScale 中推出。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "416b6c103ca0c3e7",
      "translationZh": "另一个强大特性是 ZeRO-Offload（论文）。它把一部分处理和内存需求转移到主机的 CPU 上，从而让 GPU 装下更多东西。你在 24GB GPU 成功运行 t5-3b 的战绩中已经见识了它的巨大威力。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22058e61af826dd5",
      "translationZh": "很多人在 pytorch 论坛上抱怨的另一个问题是 GPU 显存碎片化。常常会碰到看起来像这样的 OOM 错误：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9452f584acfdd71",
      "translationZh": "程序想分配约 1.5GB，而 GPU 明明还有 6-7GB 空闲显存，却报告只有约 100MB 连续空闲内存并以 OOM 失败。原因在于不同大小的内存块被反复分配又释放，久而久之形成空洞，造成内存碎片：空闲显存总量很大，却没有所需大小的连续块。在上面的例子里，程序大概能分配 100MB 连续内存，但显然无法一次性拿到 1.5GB。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f53d99acea1f499",
      "translationZh": "DeepSpeed 的应对是自行管理 GPU 显存，确保长期内存分配与短期分配互不混杂，从而大幅减少碎片。论文没有展开细节，但源代码是公开的，可以看到 DeepSpeed 是如何做到的。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbcefe75a33e3026",
      "translationZh": "ZeRO 是 Zero Redundancy Optimizer（零冗余优化器）的缩写——它的确名不虚传。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4a65d69ae3e02360",
      "translationZh": "未来",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73c1920c8c1acd5d",
      "translationZh": "除了预期中即将支持的模型参数分片，DeepSpeed 已经发布了我们尚未探索的新特性，包括 DeepSpeed Sparse Attention 和 1-bit Adam，据称能降低内存占用并大幅减少 GPU 间通信开销，从而带来更快的训练，并支持更大的模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4c9a690b5919b51",
      "translationZh": "我相信 FairScale 团队也会带来新的礼物，我想他们同样在做 ZeRO stage 3。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1feb2b9808b234c8",
      "translationZh": "更令人兴奋的是，ZeRO 正在被集成进 pytorch。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "870a8ffd98f4f2bd",
      "translationZh": "部署",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16ca0127b7ba5eec",
      "translationZh": "如果你觉得这篇博文中分享的结果令人心动，请前往这里了解如何在 transformers Trainer 中使用 DeepSpeed 和 FairScale 的细节。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d3b6bc5ca7e7614",
      "translationZh": "当然，你也可以按照各项目的说明修改自己的训练器来集成 DeepSpeed 和 FairScale，或者可以“作弊”一下，看看我们在 transformers Trainer 里是怎么做的。若选后者，可以在源码里 grep deepspeed 和/或 sharded_ddp 来找到方向。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94bbaea8062a749d",
      "translationZh": "好消息是 ZeRO 不需要修改模型本身，唯一需要修改的是训练代码。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "666067dd376e5d45",
      "translationZh": "问题反馈",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "047db4b1ca7b466e",
      "translationZh": "如果你在这两个项目的集成部分遇到任何问题，请在 transformers 中开一个 Issue。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7c2f23bb161a965",
      "translationZh": "但如果你遇到的是 DeepSpeed 和 FairScale 的安装、配置与部署问题，就需要咨询各自领域的专家，请改用 DeepSpeed Issue 或 FairScale Issue。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d42b5f4fd1efed63",
      "translationZh": "虽然你其实不必理解这些项目的工作原理，通过 transformers Trainer 就能直接使用它们，但如果你想弄清其中的来龙去脉，请参考以下资源。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "389e15cd34ce386b",
      "translationZh": "FairScale GitHub",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88e324085b104546",
      "translationZh": "DeepSpeed GitHub",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "851797034a14cab9",
      "translationZh": "论文：ZeRO: Memory Optimizations Toward Training Trillion Parameter Models。这篇论文非常有趣，但写得非常简略。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e0f9c2280b66b60",
      "translationZh": "这里有一个配合图解、讨论该论文的优秀视频",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56c1d93499faf509",
      "translationZh": "论文：ZeRO-Offload: Democratizing Billion-Scale Model Training。刚发表——这篇详细讲解了 ZeRO Offload 特性。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "865779343f710a77",
      "translationZh": "DeepSpeed 配置与教程",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02eb71efb9ab40e3",
      "translationZh": "除论文之外，我强烈推荐阅读下面这几篇带图解的详细博文：",
